     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHi D-RUGgies!</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nYou&#39;re invited to join the DataLab speaker series <span style=\"font-weight:700\">\r\n10:30-11:30 every Tuesday</span> in <span style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/location/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/location/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464268632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1P4xxiSSCZofC2Ax3sVoM9\"><u>DataLab</u></a></span> and on\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\"><a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/meeting/register/adjlIkQOS0-GASMhXF7g_A\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/meeting/register/adjlIkQOS0-GASMhXF7g_A&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464268632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jFVY3fMA41qho8jWM3G0K\"><u>Zoom</u></a></span>.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nJoin us for <span style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464268632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lfShG0J4pnQRvQ3r-NvLC\"><u>DataLab</u></a></span>’s new speaker series every Tuesday morning\r\n this quarter! The series focuses on how researchers use data science methods and technologies in practice. It will include a mix of presentations about active and completed research projects, industry projects, new methods and technologies of interest to the\r\n community, and more. The series is organized by DataLab staff and graduate student affiliates.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nFor our <span style=\"font-weight:700\">inaugural meeting on April 21st</span>, Dylon Fleming (UC Davis Dept. of Physics and Astronomy) will present “Data Management in the Accelerator Neutrino Neutron Interaction Experiment (ANNIE)”.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nFollowing the presentation, we’ll have a social hour beginning at 11:30. Enjoy tea, coffee, and light snacks while you connect with others from across the UC Davis community.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nPlease help spread the word. All members of the UC Davis community (students, staff, and faculty) are welcome to attend. We look forward to seeing you there!</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nQuestions? Interested in presenting or becoming an affiliate? Contact <span style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\">\r\n<a href style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><u>dat...@ucdavis.edu</u></a></span>.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
